id: bestial-evolution
name: Bestial Evolution
order: 3
# (1) A Bestial Trait chosen as it is gained, and gone with it (racial.mjs grantOtherTrait).
grantsOther: bestial
description: >
  Mimicking the most useful traits in nature, you enhance your body in a feral, animalistic way.
text: >
  Bestial Evolution: Mimicking the most useful traits in nature, you enhance your body in a feral, animalistic way.
  (1)-[Passive]: Select and gain a Bestial Trait of your choice while you have this Evolution Trait.

---

# (1) Nothing of its own to run: the Bestial Trait chosen is an Item of its own, given by this one (its header's
# `grantsOther`), in the Other Traits list - and taken off with it.
